 <span class=\"ap deploy-step\" data-ap=\"source\"><span class=\"deploy-ico\">💻</span>源码</span>\n      <span class=\"deploy-arrow\">→</span>\n      <span class=\"ap deploy-step\" data-ap=\"build\"><span class=\"deploy-ico\">📦</span>打包产物</span>\n      <span class=\"deploy-arrow\">→</span>\n      <span class=\"ap deploy-step\" data-ap=\"host\"><span class=\"deploy-ico\">☁️</span>托管平台</span>\n      <span class=\"deploy-arrow\">→</span>\n      <span class=\"ap deploy-step deploy-on\" data-ap=\"url\"><span class=\"deploy-ico\">🌐</span><span class=\"deploy-url\">公网网址</span></span>\n    </div>","demo_en":"<div class=\"deploy-demo\">\n      <span class=\"ap deploy-step\" data-ap=\"source\"><span class=\"deploy-ico\">💻</span>Source code</span>\n      <span class=\"deploy-arrow\">→</span>\n      <span class=\"ap deploy-step\" data-ap=\"build\"><span class=\"deploy-ico\">📦</span>Packaged product</span>\n      <span class=\"deploy-arrow\">→</span>\n      <span class=\"ap deploy-step\" data-ap=\"host\"><span class=\"deploy-ico\">☁️</span>Hosting platform</span>\n      <span class=\"deploy-arrow\">→</span>\n      <span class=\"ap deploy-step deploy-on\" data-ap=\"url\"><span class=\"deploy-ico\">🌐</span><span class=\"deploy-url\">Public network URL</span></span>\n    </div>","parts":[{"key":"source","cn":"源码","en":"Source","desc":"你写的或 AI 生成的源文件，浏览器不一定直接能跑","desc_en":"Source files written by you or generated by AI may not be directly run by the browser."},{"key":"build","cn":"打包产物","en":"Build Output","desc":"静态前端常生成 dist；服务项目也可能由平台从源码构建并启动","desc_en":"Static frontends often generate dist; service projects may also be built and started from source by the platform"},{"key":"host","cn":"目标平台","en":"Runtime Platform","desc":"平台按配置托管静态文件、函数或服务，并提供相应运行环境","desc_en":"The platform hosts static files, functions, or services based on its configuration and provides the runtime environment"},{"key":"url","cn":"访问地址","en":"URL","desc":"公开网站通常有平台分配的地址；内部服务可能只在私网或服务间访问","desc_en":"Public websites usually have addresses assigned by the platform; internal services may only be accessible on private networks or between services"}]},"variants":[{"cn":"Vercel / Netlify","en":"Vercel & Netlify","demo":"<span style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">vercel --prod</span>","demo_en":"<span style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">vercel --prod</span>","when":"前端项目常用；函数和服务能力要看具体平台与套餐","when_en":"A common choice for frontend projects; available features depend on the platform and plan"},{"cn":"GitHub Pages","en":"GitHub Pages","demo":"<span style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">Settings → Pages</span>","demo_en":"<span style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">Settings → Pages</span>","when":"为仓库提供静态网站托管；权限和可用功能以当前方案为准","when_en":"Host a static site directly from a repository; available controls and features depend on the plan"},{"cn":"自建服务器","en":"VPS","demo":"<span style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">ssh user@1.2.3.4</span>","demo_en":"<span style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">ssh user@1.2.3.4</span>","when":"需要长期运行服务，并能自行维护系统与部署时","when_en":"Run a long-lived service when your team can maintain the server and manage deployments"}],"use":[{"t":"<b>确认构建或启动方式</b>：静态前端要看输出目录；服务还要看启动命令、端口和运行时","m":"deployment-build"},{"t":"根据静态网站、长期运行服务、定时任务或内部应用等项目类型选择托管平台","m":"deployment-platform"},{"t":"<b>连 {c:git} 仓库自动部署</b>：按配置匹配的分支 push 可触发构建和发布","m":"deployment-auto"},{"t":"<b>公开网站绑定自己的{c:domain}</b>：平台给的网址可换成你的域名","m":"deployment-domain"}],"dont":[{"t":"不要把 localhost 地址当作已部署版本；它通常只在当前电脑上可用","m":"deployment-localhost-bad","bad":true},{"t":"双击 html <b>能打开不等于已经部署</b>：file:// 指向本机文件，不是可共享的部署地址","m":"deployment-file-bad","bad":true},{"t":"<b>不看平台配置就上传</b>：构建命令或输出目录错了，线上就会失败","m":"deployment-nobuild-bad","bad":true},{"t":"上线后<b>不做正式环境验收</b>：资源 404、环境变量缺失等问题会直接出现在正式页面","m":"deployment-notest-bad","bad":true}],"lessonPractice":{"title":"代码已经合并，怎样确认用户实际访问到的是新版本？","options":[{"id":"release-check","label":"确认构建和部署成功，再用生产地址检查版本标识和关键路径","feedback":"对。合并不等于上线；需要同时确认部署平台和真实用户入口。","correct":true},{"id":"merged","label":"看到 main 有新提交就宣布上线","feedback":"构建、部署、缓存或环境配置仍可能让生产停在旧版本。","correct":false},{"id":"local","label":"本地打开正常就算生产已更新","feedback":"本地环境无法证明生产构建和发布结果。","correct":false}],"en":{"title":"Code is merged. How do you confirm users are actually receiving the new version?","options":[{"id":"release-check","label":"Confirm build and deployment success, then check a version signal and key path on production","feedback":"Correct. Merge is not release; verify both the platform and the real user entry point.","correct":true},{"id":"merged","label":"Announce release when main has the new commit","feedback":"Build, deployment, cache, or environment configuration can still leave production on an old version.","correct":false},{"id":"local","label":"Count a working local page as production updated","feedback":"Local behavior cannot prove the production build and release.","correct":false}]}},"lessonAgentPrompt":{"title":"你可以这样告诉 AI Agent","text":"请把当前 commit 部署到已授权的测试环境，不要改动生产。记录 commit hash、目标项目和环境；确认构建与部署日志成功后，打开测试地址检查页面版本标识和登录入口。任一步失败就停止，说明失败阶段和日志线索。","en":{"title":"You can say this to an AI Agent","text":"Deploy the current commit to the authorized test environment without touching production. Record the commit hash, target project, and environment. After successful build and deployment logs, open the test URL and verify its version signal plus the sign-in entry. Stop on any failure and report the stage and log evidence."}},"references":[{"title":"发布你的网站","source":"MDN","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Learn_web_development/Getting_started/Your_first_website/Publishing_your_website","title_en":"Publishing your website"}],"scenes":["Vercel 部署成功页","终端 npm run build","push 触发自动部署","浏览器打开公网网址"],"en":{"use":[{"t":"Publish a website","m":"deployment-build"},{"t":"Release a new application version","m":"deployment-platform"},{"t":"Run a backend service","m":"deployment-auto"},{"t":"Create preview environments for review","m":"deployment-domain"}],"dont":[{"t":"Deploy unreviewed secrets or local-only settings","m":"deployment-localhost-bad","bad":true},{"t":"Assume a successful build means the service is healthy","m":"deployment-file-bad","bad":true},{"t":"Change production manually with no record","m":"deployment-nobuild-bad","bad":true},{"t":"Release without knowing how to roll back","m":"deployment-notest-bad","bad":true}],"scenes":["Production release","Preview deployment","Backend service","Static website"],"sceneUI":["<div style=\"max-width:420px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:22px;text-align:center\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:26px\">🎉</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;margin:6px 0 2px\">Congratulations!</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">my-first-page deployed successfully</div>\n      <div style=\"margin:12px auto;max-width:300px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;padding:10px;background:var(--bg-soft)\">\n        <div style=\"height:44px;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border-light);border-radius:5px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">Page preview</div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--brand)\">my-first-page.vercel.app</div>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"margin-top:10px\">Visit →</button>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:420px;margin:0 auto\" class=\"terminal-win\">\n      <div class=\"terminal-bar\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>zsh — my-first-page</span></div>\n      <div class=\"terminal-body\">\n        <span><b class=\"terminal-p\">$<